Project Query 21 — CASE WHEN

SELECT
    account_id,
    customer_id,
    balance,

    CASE
        WHEN balance >= 100000 THEN 'HIGH'
        WHEN balance >= 50000 THEN 'MEDIUM'
        ELSE 'LOW'
    END AS balance_category

FROM accounts;

Result conceptually:

