Project Query 30 — Possible Suspicious Transactions

Suppose:

Transactions above ₹75,000 should be flagged for review.

SELECT
    transaction_id,
    account_id,
    amount,

    CASE
        WHEN amount >= 75000 THEN 'REVIEW'
        ELSE 'NORMAL'
    END AS risk_flag

FROM transactions;

Important:

This is not a real fraud detection model.

It's simply a SQL-based business rule.

Later, when we study Machine Learning, we can build actual predictive fraud models.
